            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7-4-2-2 A request for a Level Two hearing will be transmitted in writing by the Association to the Office of Employee Relations within ten (10) school days after receipt of the Level One decision, or fifteen (15) school days after the Level One hearing, whichever is sooner.",
